01:02:51.650 --> 01:02:56.540
<v Brian>I'm there in cut-off sweatpants and a hoodie, wearing a mask.
<v Brian>我穿着剪短的运动裤和连帽衫，戴着口罩在那里。

01:02:56.540 --> 01:03:00.380
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

